00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:01.010
- Erik Varga wants to know this,

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:04.570
What would you say is the most accurate

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:08.460
time travel show or movie and why?

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:09.630
Oooh.

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:10.773
- Hmm ...

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:14.110
It's really hard

00:06:14.110 --> 00:06:17.750
to do, an accurate movie

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:20.120
and still have interesting plot lines.

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:21.230
So ...

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:22.840
given that,

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:23.700
they take some

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:25.530
loosey goosey steps

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:28.720
with time travel, I have to say

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:32.790
that Doctor Who as a TV series

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:34.890
is the most invested

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:38.420
