have their own solutions

00:06:45.418 --> 00:06:47.520
to all that.

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:51.110
Now on the state side, I
would say there's nothin'

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:52.899
like the original Back
to the Future movie,

00:06:52.899 --> 00:06:54.010
the first one.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:56.331
That one they thought it through,

00:06:56.331 --> 00:06:58.853
they imagined consequences.

00:07:00.997 --> 00:07:05.360
So I give both of them
sort of equal high ranking.

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:08.973
As a special mention,
gotta love Bill and Ted.

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:13.160
Bill and Ted's excellent
adventure, come on.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:17.140
I mean, that's a special
runner up/special mention

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:20.750
